     3	//! Persists the E8-libra run wire (`docs/development/tracing/agent.md`
     4	//! E8-libra + 落地执行补充规格 §5): per run one directory containing
     5	//! `state.json`, `manifest.json`, `findings.md` and
     6	//! `reviewers/<slug>.stdout.redacted.log` / `.stderr.redacted.log`.
     7	//!
     8	//! Modeled on [`crate::internal::ai::agent_run::event_store::AgentRunEventStore`]:
     9	//! the store is stateless beyond its `sessions_root`, every write is a
    10	//! whole-file JSON overwrite (`fs::write` of `serde_json::to_vec_pretty`)
    11	//! and reads tolerate missing files. A run directory is written by exactly
    12	//! one producer (the runner driving that run) plus the small cross-process
    13	//! cancel/clean surface below; concurrent multi-writer coordination is out
    14	//! of scope for AG-22.
    15	
