   563	
   564	**Task type:** `<implementation | migration | removal | spike | audit | docs | release | handoff>`（G-11）
   565	
   566	**Lifecycle / Acceptance:** `<pending | in-progress | blocked | done>` / `<空 | locally-accepted | remote-pending | complete>`（ER-04；两者正交，`done` 以 `complete` 为前提）
